Checklists for Jira (Forge) is a port of "jira-checklist-plugin"
(https://github.com/samid737/jira-checklist-plugin), an Atlassian Connect app
by samid737, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The original stored checklists in the Jira issue entity property "todos";
this port preserves that property and data shape for full compatibility.
